==========================

The icons and splash screens currently in this directory are generated
placeholders (scripts/placeholder-art.py) that show the name "Silo" in a plain
pixel font. They are not the Silo logo or wordmark, and official Silo artwork
will replace them.

The files in images/ui/ (card corner frames, focus rings, fade scrims, the
card placeholder's colour glow, circle outlines, and a magnifier) are plain
shapes generated by scripts/ui-art.py. The files in images/firstrun/
(colour gradients behind the first-run screens, capsules, rounded panels,
